   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Arendal S. de R.L de C.V.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Arendal is a Mexican company founded in 1997, specializing, inter alia, in the construction of pipelines, plants, electromechanical and heavy civil engineering works, directional drilling, and fiber optic networks. The purpose of the loan is to make use of company knowledge of the market and increase its human capital, in addition to adopting sophisticated systems and tools.The IIC&#x2019;s revolving credit line of up to MX$100.0 million will be used for working capital loans to finance contracts with Petr&#xf3;leos Mexicanos (&#x201c;PEMEX&#x201d;).</narrative>
  </description>
